WEBVTT

00:01.014 --> 00:06.014
<b></b>

00:11.564 --> 00:13.524
<b>Man, this is great!</b>

00:15.504 --> 00:19.014
<b>Yeah, the beach is awesome, I can't lie.</b>

00:19.014 --> 00:22.964
<b>But like, did you forget that we were
supposed to be <i>doing something</i>?</b>

00:22.964 --> 00:24.174
<b>What thing?</b>

00:24.174 --> 00:28.344
<b>Getting the Emerald Tear or whatever,
and making some bank?</b>

00:28.344 --> 00:30.014
<b>If we don't, we're bro—</b>

00:30.514 --> 00:31.424
<b>Oh no.</b>

00:31.424 --> 00:35.464
<b>Couldn't dodge that,
so now you're my servant for life.</b>

00:35.464 --> 00:38.984
<b>Pretty harsh penalty for
being caught in an ambush.</b>

00:39.434 --> 00:41.444
<b>Here, hit it back.</b>

00:44.344 --> 00:46.534
<b>Is two-person volleyball meant to be fun?{Could totally add "beach" here, didn't because of CPS and it's not really that relevant is it.}</b>

00:47.614 --> 00:50.494
<b>What, you don't like playing with me?</b>

00:51.504 --> 00:54.334
<b>I didn't mean it like that.</b>

00:55.864 --> 00:57.674
<b>Then let's take a ride on that!</b>

01:01.634 --> 01:04.594
<b>You're really not going to row at all?</b>

01:05.594 --> 01:09.554
<b>How could I tarnish your
very first task as my servant?</b>

01:09.554 --> 01:15.524
<b>I swear I'm always doing
whatever you want, punishment or not.</b>

01:19.564 --> 01:21.944
<b>You're not in bad shape.</b>

01:22.724 --> 01:24.444
<b>Stop that.</b>

01:25.904 --> 01:27.594
<b>Nobody's looking.</b>

01:29.444 --> 01:32.974
<b>Not sure if that makes it okay.</b>

01:36.834 --> 01:39.794
<b>You really aren't enjoying this?</b>

01:40.584 --> 01:42.604
<b>It's not that...</b>

01:44.954 --> 01:47.554
<b>I'm just realizing how far we've come.</b>

01:48.794 --> 01:54.224
<b>It's been two years since we first met,
 on that day in the sky.</b>

01:55.144 --> 01:56.734
<b>Now we're out at sea.</b>

01:58.134 --> 01:59.144
<b>Ok, and?</b>

01:59.144 --> 02:01.804
<b>Are you finally enjoying yourself?</b>

02:01.804 --> 02:03.104
<b>Or not?</b>

02:04.204 --> 02:08.074
<b>Someday, when this journey is over, I'll tell you.</b>

02:09.504 --> 02:10.434
<b>All right.</b>

02:11.054 --> 02:12.344
<b>That's definitely your style.</b>

02:13.374 --> 02:17.804
<b>Oh, but if you were gonna ask me out,
you should hurry it up.</b>

02:17.804 --> 02:19.874
<b>There's a long line.</b>

02:19.874 --> 02:21.334
<b>Not on the books.</b>

02:21.334 --> 02:22.834
<b>Also, stop gassing yourself up.</b>

02:23.224 --> 02:25.144
<b>Be that as it may...</b>

02:25.144 --> 02:26.304
<b>Be <i>what </i>as it may?</b>

02:26.304 --> 02:30.574
<b>Once we get the jewel and
eat a bunch of high-quality meat,</b>

02:30.574 --> 02:33.264
<b>shall we set up a detective
agency somewhere?</b>

02:33.734 --> 02:37.774
<b>Those don't sound like the words of
someone who's pretty much penniless.</b>

02:39.864 --> 02:43.114
<b><i>Just like that, our fleeting
summer vacation passed,</i></b>

02:43.544 --> 02:48.464
<b><i>and our crazy lives as
detective and assistant continued.</i></b>

02:50.374 --> 02:54.234
From the very moment you caught my eye

02:50.374 --> 02:54.234
<b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>wo </b><b>mi</b><b>te</b><b>ta </b><b>a</b><b>no </b><b>hi </b><b>ka</b><b>ra</b>

02:54.414 --> 03:02.354
It felt like everything would change

02:54.414 --> 03:02.354
<b>su</b><b>be</b><b>te </b><b>ga </b><b></b><b>ka</b><b>wa</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b><b>u </b><b>na </b><b>ki </b><b>ga </b><b>shi</b><b>te</b><b>ta</b>

