<b>yu</b><b>me </b><b>wo </b><b>mi</b><b>te</b><b>ta </b><b>ki </b><b>ga </b><b>shi</b><b>ta</b>

03:14.724 --> 03:20.134
Echoing with footsteps whose sound is now lost

03:14.724 --> 03:20.134
<b>i</b><b>ma </b><b>ja</b><b>a </b><b>mo </b><b>ki</b><b>ko</b><b>e</b><b>na</b><b>i </b><b>a</b><b>shi</b><b></b><b>o</b><b>to </b><b>de</b>

03:20.674 --> 03:24.394
Yet when I opened my eyes

03:20.674 --> 03:24.394
<b>me </b><b>wo </b><b>a</b><b>ke</b><b>re</b><b>ba </b><b>i</b><b>tsu</b><b>mo </b><b>to</b>

03:24.824 --> 03:29.824
You were missing, as always

03:24.824 --> 03:29.824
<b>o</b><b>na</b><b>ji </b><b>ta</b><b>da </b><b>hi</b><b>to</b><b>ri </b><b>ki</b><b>ta</b><b>i </b><b></b><b>shi</b><b>te</b><b>i</b><b>ta</b>

03:30.194 --> 03:34.044
You know, all those things I was unable to say

03:30.194 --> 03:34.044
<b>ne</b><b>e, </b><b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>ni </b><b></b><b>i</b><b>e</b><b>na</b><b>ka</b><b>t</b><b>ta </b><b>ko</b><b>to</b>

03:34.294 --> 03:38.884
Have remained bottled up to this day

03:34.294 --> 03:38.884
<b>i</b><b>ma </b><b>mo </b><b>to</b><b>ji</b><b>ko</b><b>me</b><b>te</b><b>ru</b>

03:40.144 --> 03:42.384
My heart is still searching

03:40.144 --> 03:42.384
<b>a</b><b>no </b><b>se</b><b>ka</b><b>i </b><b>de </b><b>mi</b><b>tsu</b><b>ke</b><b>ta</b>

03:42.524 --> 03:44.784
For that important thing

03:42.524 --> 03:44.784
<b>ta</b><b>i</b><b>se</b><b>tsu </b><b>na </b><b>na</b><b>ni</b><b>ka </b><b>wo</b>

03:45.044 --> 03:49.454
It discovered in that world.

03:45.044 --> 03:49.454
<b>ko</b><b>no </b><b>ko</b><b>ko</b><b>ro </b><b>wa </b><b>sa</b><b>ga</b><b>shi</b><b>mo</b><b>to</b><b>me</b><b>te</b><b>ru</b>

03:49.734 --> 03:52.434
Hey, I want us to always smile together

03:49.734 --> 03:52.434
<b>ne</b><b>e, </b><b>zu</b><b>t</b><b>to </b><b>ko</b><b>ko </b><b>de </b><b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>to</b>

03:52.654 --> 03:55.084
So right here and now

03:52.654 --> 03:55.084
<b>wa</b><b>ra</b><b>t</b><b>te </b><b>i</b><b>ra</b><b>re</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b><b>u </b><b>ni</b>

03:55.364 --> 03:58.874
I'll make you a promise

03:55.364 --> 03:58.874
<b>ya</b><b>ku</b><b>so</b><b>ku </b><b>wo </b><b>su</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b>

04:00.514 --> 04:03.054
That will transcend time

04:00.514 --> 04:03.054
<b>to</b><b>ki </b><b>wo </b><b>ko</b><b>e</b><b>te, </b><b>i</b><b>ma</b>

04:20.014 --> 04:24.024
Episode 5

04:20.014 --> 04:24.024
Episode 5

04:20.014 --> 04:24.024
That Was Directed at One Year in the Future

04:20.014 --> 04:24.024
That Was Directed at One Year in the Future

04:24.204 --> 04:27.424
<b>This is the work of Cerberus.</b>

04:28.014 --> 04:29.504
<b>Cerberus?</b>

04:30.394 --> 04:31.904
<b>That's a weird voice.</b>

04:31.904 --> 04:34.264
<b>Don't really handle blood well.</b>

04:37.504 --> 04:41.934
<b>At least decide between
cringing and plugging your nose.</b>

04:42.864 --> 04:48.404
<b>So this Cerberus is a brand new
"classic" serial killer, huh?</b>

04:49.064 --> 04:49.864
<b>That's right.</b>

04:49.864 --> 04:51.934
<b>Code name: Cerberus.</b>

04:51.934 --> 04:53.614
<b>They say the underworld's guard dog</b>

04:54.164 --> 04:57.264
<b>feeds on the hearts of humans.</b>

05:02.094 --> 05:03.444
<b>Sure took your time.</b>

05:04.864 --> 05:06.734
<b>This is a no-smoking zone.</b>

05:07.314 --> 05:08.684
<b>Oh, all yours then.</b>

05:10.824 --> 05:12.704
<b>I've got a flight to catch.</b>

05:12.704 --> 05:14.214
<b>I'm headed back to Japan.</b>

05:14.214 --> 05:15.984
<b>What, already?</b>

05:15.984 --> 05:19.804
<b>I mean, why come all the way here then?</b>

05:20.364 --> 05:24.274
<b>A temporary transfer,
though technically that ended yesterday.</b>

05:24.274 --> 05:27.234
<b>I've never heard of a transfer like that.</b>

05:27.234 --> 05:31.294
<b>So yeah, I'll be leaving
the dirty work to you two.</b>

05:31.294 --> 05:34.664
<b>Bust this modern-day
Jack the Ripper for us.</b>

05:35.154 --> 05:37.484
<b>Wait, but why?</b>

05:41.584 --> 05:43.034
<b>You kidding me?</b>

05:43.034 --> 05:44.794
<b>Why do I have to...?</b>

05:45.234 --> 05:46.544
<b>What's that there?</b>

05:46.914 --> 05:50.474
<b>Ms. Fuubi gave it to me
just before she left.</b>

05:50.474 --> 05:53.424
<b>She said she gave it up
'cause she was quitting smoking.</b>

05:53.854 --> 05:55.044
<b>I see.</b>

05:55.044 --> 05:59.934
<b>She gave her most valued possession
 to a guy she'd finally met again after a long time.</b>

06:00.264 --> 06:03.884
<b>Yeah, she sure gave me a lot:
a half-smoked cigar, a lighter,</b>

06:03.884 --> 06:05.894
<b>and a serial killer case.</b>

06:07.214 --> 06:09.944
<b>So, what's the killer's motive?</b>

06:09.944 --> 06:13.364
<b>Why is Cerberus going around
stealing people's hearts?</b>

06:14.154 --> 06:18.094
<b>It's pretty hard to imagine that
Cerberus is doing this all of his own accord.</b>

06:18.804 --> 06:22.324
<b>I would bet that this is being done
under orders from a higher entity.</b>

06:22.874 --> 06:25.284
<b>Higher... you mean SPES?</b>

06:25.654 --> 06:29.564
<b>Well, we can get the motive
out of the culprit after catching them.</b>

06:29.564 --> 06:31.654
<b>Got a plan to do just that?</b>

06:32.584 --> 06:37.254
<b>I was actually aware of
this case prior to our involvement.</b>

06:37.254 --> 06:42.254
<b>Yeah, no chance you'd
miss the bus on something this extreme.</b>

06:42.254 --> 06:44.634
<b>The assailant seems to have a great nose.</b>

06:44.634 --> 06:48.724
<b>Try as I might to get close, the killer
has slipped away again and again.</b>

06:49.244 --> 06:55.194
<b>Bat has his ear, so Cerberus could be
an android with a reconstructed nose.</b>

06:57.774 --> 07:02.824
<b>But even though we're in town right now,</b>

07:02.824 --> 07:05.234
<b>Cerberus is still committing these crimes.</b>

07:05.234 --> 07:06.214
<b>A trap?</b>

07:08.234 --> 07:10.954
<b>I'm trying to say this is our chance.</b>

07:10.954 --> 07:14.924
<b>Maybe that's true,
but just how are we going about it?</b>

07:15.264 --> 07:16.714
<b>You've got it backwards.</b>

07:16.714 --> 07:19.644
<b>We're not going to pursue Cerberus.</b>

07:19.644 --> 07:22.134
<b>Cerberus is going to come after us.</b>

07:26.194 --> 07:28.814
<b>Oh god, don't tell me you're
going to make me a decoy?</b>

07:29.434 --> 07:32.024
<b>Your deduction skills
have really improved.</b>

07:32.864 --> 07:36.734
<b>So, how about we work out
the plan over afternoon tea?</b>

07:36.734 --> 07:39.084
<b>You're the only person in existence</b>

07:39.084 --> 07:42.824
<b>who can go straight from a
murder scene to afternoon tea.</b>

07:43.294 --> 07:47.274
<b>Besides, didn't you obliterate a Sunday roast before we came here?</b>

07:47.734 --> 07:50.604
<b>My brain is constantly in overdrive,</b>

07:50.604 --> 07:53.664
<b>so I'm like an animal when
it comes to a lot of things.</b>

07:53.984 --> 07:56.004
<b>So that's why you're always napping.</b>

07:56.444 --> 07:59.094
<b>You're one to talk, Mr. Late Riser.</b>

08:00.534 --> 08:03.724
<b>Wait, you can be an
<i>animal</i> when it comes to...</b>

08:07.524 --> 08:10.214
<b>Just eating and sleeping. Nothing else.</b>

08:13.354 --> 08:17.404
<b>It's coming up on three years since we began travelling the world together.</b>

08:18.164 --> 08:20.544
<b>Feels like it was just yesterday.</b>

08:20.544 --> 08:23.374
<b>Don't get all nostalgic on me now.</b>

08:23.774 --> 08:26.864
<b>You are going to come save me
before I get murdered, right?</b>

08:28.634 --> 08:32.584
<b>Assistant or no,
I don't feel like putting my life on the line.</b>

08:33.474 --> 08:38.764
<b>So, is Cerberus really
going to come to this room?</b>

08:39.344 --> 08:40.424
<b>Not to worry.</b>

08:40.424 --> 08:42.424
<b>If I've read
the situation right,</b>

08:42.424 --> 08:45.794
<b>you'll be devoured by Cerberus tonight.</b>

08:45.794 --> 08:47.934
<b>So I'm just getting killed?</b>

08:48.314 --> 08:52.264
<b>Honestly, I'm not sure if it's
 actually tonight or not.</b>

08:52.264 --> 08:53.754
<b>Right...</b>

08:53.754 --> 08:58.284
<b>We're just guessing that Cerberus is 
more likely to target me when I'm away from you.{Split on these last two lines kinda weird.}</b>

08:58.284 --> 09:00.614
<b>I do have a plan, for what it's worth,</b>

09:00.614 --> 09:03.784
<b>so whenever you're attacked, there's
a 1 in 10,000 chance you'll survive.</b>

09:06.334 --> 09:09.554
<b>So my odds are 1 in 10'000, eh.</b>

09:10.434 --> 09:12.244
<b>I can't come near you,</b>

09:12.864 --> 09:17.344
<b>but I'll at least stay on the phone
with you, so you're not lonely.</b>

09:45.874 --> 09:50.394
<b>Sorry 'bout that, but I'm pretty used to people trying to kill me.</b>

09:50.954 --> 09:52.034
<b>Hey!</b>

09:52.034 --> 09:54.494
<b>Stop jumping to conclusions!</b>

10:01.054 --> 10:02.044
<b>Char!</b>

10:02.044 --> 10:04.004
<b>Why are you...?</b>

10:04.874 --> 10:07.034
<b>Ah, I see.</b>

10:07.034 --> 10:08.974
<b>Siesta asked you to come?</b>

10:09.454 --> 10:10.654
<b>That's right!</b>

10:10.654 --> 10:15.344
<b>Seriously, using all your
might to hurl a girl onto a bed...</b>

10:15.344 --> 10:17.724
<b>Who taught you manners?</b>

10:18.144 --> 10:22.704
<b>You're gonna focus on that when
you just waltzed into my room</b>

10:22.704 --> 10:25.694
<b>in the dead of night, without a word?</b>

10:25.694 --> 10:27.234
<b>That's because, you know,</b>

10:27.234 --> 10:30.654
<b>it's possible that Cerberus
had gotten here before me.</b>

10:32.294 --> 10:37.714
<b>Even then, Siesta could've
told me to expect you.</b>

10:38.154 --> 10:41.424
<b>Keeping things under wraps
is part of Siesta's strategy, right?</b>

10:44.604 --> 10:45.754
<b>What?</b>

10:46.584 --> 10:49.264
<b>Who are you?</b>

10:49.704 --> 10:52.974
<b>Char never calls Siesta by her name.</b>

10:54.774 --> 10:56.244
<b>How interesting. {isn't this guy kotomine VA?}</b>

10:56.244 --> 10:58.224
<b>So I've been found out.</b>

11:08.124 --> 11:10.114
<b>So you can do that...</b>

11:10.464 --> 11:12.574
<b>It's a full moon tonight.</b>

11:13.254 --> 11:15.074
<b>My blood is crying out.</b>

11:25.244 --> 11:28.554
<b>I'll take that heart.</b>

11:28.554 --> 11:30.714
<b>So you're Cerberus.</b>

11:44.664 --> 11:47.234
<b>You're way too jacked.</b>

12:09.064 --> 12:11.364
<b>I've gotta buy myself some time...</b>

12:11.864 --> 12:13.384
<b>Oho.</b>

12:13.384 --> 12:16.084
<b>You seem to handle yourself well.</b>

12:16.084 --> 12:19.064
<b>I thought you were just
the detective's flunky,</b>

12:19.064 --> 12:21.854
<b>but it seems I may have to reconsider.</b>

12:24.074 --> 12:26.924
<b>Why are you doing all this?</b>

12:27.564 --> 12:28.814
<b>What's your purpose?</b>

12:29.184 --> 12:30.814
<b>I have no motive.</b>

12:30.814 --> 12:33.924
<b>I'm only carrying
out my assigned mission.</b>

12:33.924 --> 12:36.914
<b>Killing you is also a part of that mission.</b>

12:38.124 --> 12:39.574
<b>Prepare yourself!</b>

12:42.064 --> 12:43.024
Siesta

12:42.614 --> 12:43.444
<b>Get down.</b>

13:00.954 --> 13:03.144
<b>Took you long enough.</b>

13:03.704 --> 13:05.824
<b>I was on time, so it's fine, right?</b>

13:06.514 --> 13:07.604
<b>Did you miss me?</b>

13:09.854 --> 13:15.714
<b>Even with my nose,
I couldn't sense your presence.</b>

13:15.714 --> 13:16.904
<b>How?{@ Timers this line needs a split, bad.}</b>

13:19.304 --> 13:23.834
<b>Until just a moment ago,
this room was filled with a special gas.</b>

13:23.834 --> 13:24.994
<b>Gas?</b>

13:26.784 --> 13:27.754
<b>It can't be...</b>

13:28.424 --> 13:32.914
<b>She anticipated this would happen
and rigged gas to supplement the water?</b>

13:32.914 --> 13:35.984
<b>As a result, Cerberus's sense
of smell was incapacitated...</b>

13:36.814 --> 13:39.434
<b>As usual, you've taken
preparation to extremes.</b>

13:40.154 --> 13:43.644
<b>I had faith that you'd
definitely do just what you did.</b>

13:44.074 --> 13:46.644
<b>And with that, I win.</b>

13:46.644 --> 13:48.654
<b>Time to accept it.</b>

13:49.604 --> 13:53.424
<b>I can't get caught yet...</b>

13:56.404 --> 13:57.614
<b>It's no use.</b>

14:03.004 --> 14:03.914
<b>Assistant!</b>

14:04.204 --> 14:05.124
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

14:08.314 --> 14:09.544
<b>You're kidding me!</b>

14:10.754 --> 14:13.214
<b>I have a mission.</b>

14:13.204 --> 14:14.714
<b>One more...</b>

14:14.714 --> 14:18.844
<b>I just need one more beating heart!</b>

14:19.674 --> 14:22.094
<b>In that case, your own will do.</b>

14:32.484 --> 14:33.194
<b>Assistant!</b>

14:35.064 --> 14:36.144
<b>Be careful.</b>

14:37.694 --> 14:41.824
<b>It's our first time actually
meeting face-to-face, isn't it.</b>

14:41.824 --> 14:43.214
<b>...Ms. Ace Detective?</b>

14:46.464 --> 14:47.614
<b>Who are you?</b>

14:49.184 --> 14:50.874
<b>My name is Hel.</b>

14:51.774 --> 14:53.984
<b>Codename: Hel.</b>

14:58.474 --> 15:01.834
<b>Codename... so she's also...</b>

15:01.834 --> 15:03.894
<b>She's SPES's supreme leader.</b>

15:04.424 --> 15:06.354
<b>All right then.</b>

15:23.294 --> 15:25.824
<b>With this, the last part has been gathered.</b>

15:25.824 --> 15:28.904
<b>Now to take this back
and execute the pla—</b>

15:28.904 --> 15:30.794
<b>You think I'll let you?</b>

15:34.494 --> 15:36.214
<b>You won't be able to fire.</b>

15:36.544 --> 15:37.784
<b>What's that supposed to mean?</b>

15:47.054 --> 15:47.894
<b>Siesta!</b>

15:49.134 --> 15:53.354
<b>Hey, should we go see
the underworld together?</b>

16:03.704 --> 16:05.134
<b>Where am I?</b>

16:12.174 --> 16:13.814
<b>Looks like you're awake.</b>

16:16.434 --> 16:17.334
<b>Hel...</b>

16:18.054 --> 16:19.194
<b>How are you feeling?</b>

16:19.884 --> 16:21.804
<b>Any pain anywhere?</b>

16:21.804 --> 16:25.014
<b>Hard to believe those are
the words of an abductor.</b>

16:25.764 --> 16:28.974
<b>I think it's only natural to be
concerned about one's partner.</b>

16:29.784 --> 16:31.434
<b>Me? Your partner?</b>

16:31.434 --> 16:32.934
<b>I don't follow.</b>

16:32.934 --> 16:35.944
<b>How could that possibly benefit you?</b>

16:36.304 --> 16:38.744
<b>You have a low opinion of yourself.</b>

16:38.744 --> 16:40.414
<b>Call it modesty.</b>

16:43.004 --> 16:45.104
<b>So you can actually laugh, eh?</b>

16:46.804 --> 16:48.764
<b>What do you think I am?</b>

16:49.274 --> 16:50.834
<b>I'm just a normal girl, after all.</b>

16:50.834 --> 16:55.794
<b>I don't think a normal girl could
kill a colleague like that.</b>

16:56.154 --> 16:57.384
<b>Colleague?</b>

16:57.384 --> 17:02.004
<b>He was nothing more than a cog in my plan.</b>

17:02.344 --> 17:05.474
<b>Do you intend to use and
discard me in that way, too?</b>

17:05.904 --> 17:07.824
<b>I would never do something like that.</b>

17:08.554 --> 17:09.494
<b>Still...</b>

17:11.344 --> 17:14.794
<b>What's inscribed in
the Sacred Writ is absolute.</b>

17:15.864 --> 17:17.394
<b>The Sacred Writ?</b>

17:17.694 --> 17:21.004
<b>Have you ever heard of
the Leaves of Agastya?</b>

17:21.514 --> 17:24.244
<b>I'm thinking of something
 about a prophetic scripture</b>

17:24.244 --> 17:26.854
<b>written before common era
 by a certain sage.{Split}</b>

17:26.854 --> 17:27.784
<b>That's right.</b>

17:27.784 --> 17:32.254
<b>This Sacred Writ originated
from the Leaves of Agastya.</b>

17:32.874 --> 17:36.254
<b>And your future, too,
is set within these pages.</b>

17:38.984 --> 17:41.174
<b>Your eyes show you don't
believe a word I'm saying.</b>

17:41.174 --> 17:43.704
<b>Yeah, but don't fret about that.</b>

17:43.704 --> 17:47.134
<b>There's only one person
I trust besides myself.</b>

17:49.534 --> 17:52.304
<b>So you were a magnet for trouble.</b>

17:53.334 --> 17:54.814
<b>That's your nature.</b>

17:55.274 --> 17:57.234
<b>How do you know that?</b>

17:58.714 --> 18:03.214
<b>But I believe your nature is
a little different from that.</b>

18:03.214 --> 18:04.884
<b>You're not a magnet for trouble.</b>

18:04.884 --> 18:07.194
<b>You bring trouble out of the world.</b>

18:07.964 --> 18:09.654
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

18:09.654 --> 18:15.004
<b>That trait of yours is an ability to
cause changes in things, to provoke incidents.</b>

18:15.004 --> 18:17.784
<b>You yourself are the center of the world.</b>

18:18.504 --> 18:19.414
<b>Therefore...</b>

18:19.994 --> 18:22.384
<b>I'm going to have you become my partner.</b>

18:22.894 --> 18:26.644
<b>In order to save the world with me.</b>

18:28.024 --> 18:30.474
<b>You misspoke—you mean,
to destroy the world.</b>

18:30.474 --> 18:33.394
<b>To me, that is salvation.</b>

18:33.394 --> 18:40.234
<b>Well, according to the Sacred Writ,
your joining me will apparently come later.</b>

18:40.614 --> 18:43.864
<b>Still, having things move
quickly is Father's—</b>

18:47.464 --> 18:49.194
<b>It's unfortunate, though.</b>

18:49.194 --> 18:52.784
<b>There'd be a lot of perks 
in partnering with me.</b>

18:53.644 --> 18:57.414
<b>So, what do you say, Kimi?</b>

18:58.364 --> 19:00.084
<b>Become my partner.</b>

19:01.004 --> 19:03.044
<b>Right, of course...</b>

19:04.394 --> 19:05.294
<b>I refuse.</b>

19:05.744 --> 19:09.344
<b>Even you didn't believe I'd
accept your offer.</b>

19:10.664 --> 19:11.634
<b>Was it that obvious?</b>

19:11.924 --> 19:17.084
<b>Well, instead, there's something
I'd like you to see.</b>

19:23.694 --> 19:24.554
<b>This.</b>

19:26.394 --> 19:28.364
<b>What is that thing?</b>

19:29.294 --> 19:30.764
<b>It's a biological weapon.</b>

19:33.284 --> 19:38.244
<b>This fella can exhale a special breath
that contains toxins.</b>

19:38.684 --> 19:41.204
<b>You mean to use it to engage
in some sort of terrorism?</b>

19:41.904 --> 19:42.914
<b>Exactly.</b>

19:45.264 --> 19:50.214
<b>On that note, I never answered
your question about where we are.</b>

19:50.574 --> 19:54.934
<b>It's an underground facility directly
beneath this nation's Parliament building.</b>

19:56.894 --> 20:01.324
<b>So if you were able to set up such a site
in a nation's nucleus of power,</b>

20:01.324 --> 20:04.664
<b>it's safe to assume you've got
some powerful allies.</b>

20:06.144 --> 20:07.024
<b>And?</b>

20:07.024 --> 20:10.074
<b>Do you mean to release that
thing in the city to feed on people?</b>

20:10.074 --> 20:12.044
<b>No, that's not it.</b>

20:12.544 --> 20:14.534
<b>We've given
it plenty of provisions.</b>

20:14.884 --> 20:16.704
<b>Provisions?</b>

20:17.614 --> 20:19.124
<b>So that's it.</b>

20:19.624 --> 20:22.584
<b>That monster eats human hearts.</b>

20:22.584 --> 20:25.834
<b>They're its provisions, or its power source.</b>

20:26.684 --> 20:28.864
<b>You truly do have good intuition.</b>

20:32.794 --> 20:35.224
<b>Betelgeuse, it's time to go to work.</b>

20:48.874 --> 20:53.654
<b>Regardless, my future partner absolutely
needs to see what happens next.</b>

20:54.284 --> 20:55.454
<b>Nah, I'm good.</b>

20:57.924 --> 20:59.874
<b>You're going to be stopped, here and now.</b>

20:59.874 --> 21:01.484
<b>How?</b>

21:01.484 --> 21:03.834
<b>What on Earth can you do,
especially unarmed?</b>

21:04.884 --> 21:07.374
<b>When did I say <i>I'd</i> stop you?</b>

21:16.234 --> 21:17.224
<b>Assistant!</b>

21:17.674 --> 21:19.434
<b>Assistant, where are you?</b>

21:20.494 --> 21:21.294
<b>Assistant!</b>

