21:25.484 --> 21:26.894
<b>Are you not here?</b>

21:26.894 --> 21:29.274
<b>Assistant... Assistant!</b>

21:30.644 --> 21:33.164
<b>This wall is in the way.</b>

21:33.164 --> 21:33.894
<b>Who needs it?</b>

21:33.894 --> 21:35.994
<b>I'll take the whole thing out!</b>

21:57.384 --> 22:00.344
